    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "epricing-service CPU %",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#9FC119",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "#E02F44",
                "value": 80
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*epricing-service.*\"}[1m])) * 100 or (sum(process_cpu_usage{job=\"epricing-service\"}) * 100)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "epricing CPU %",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**ePricing Container CPU Usage (% of 1 CPU Core)**\n\nInstant CPU utilization of the `epricing-service` container from cAdvisor (`rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total[1m]) * 100`), with JVM `process_cpu_usage` fallback if cAdvisor is unavailable. Container limit in `docker-compose.yml` is `2.0` CPUs (`200%`).\n\n- **Green:** `< 50%` | **Yellow:** `50% – 80%` | **Red:** `≥ 80%`"
    },
    {
