      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*epricing-yugabytedb.*|.*yugabytedb.*\"}[1m])) * 100",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "YugabyteDB CPU %",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**YugabyteDB Container CPU Usage (% of 1 CPU Core)**\n\nCPU consumed by `epricing-yugabytedb` (`yb-master` + `yb-tserver` + YSQL query engine) via cAdvisor.\n\n- **Green:** `< 50%` | **Yellow:** `50% – 80%` | **Red:** `≥ 80%` — High sustained CPU indicates heavy SQL writes, missing indexes, or DocDB compaction."
    },
