            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[1m])) * 100",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Node CPU Idle %",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**Host / Worker Node CPU Idle Capacity %**\n\nAverage idle CPU percentage across all host CPU cores reported by `node-exporter` (`avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[1m])) * 100`).\n\n- **Green:** `≥ 40%` idle (plenty of host headroom)\n- **Yellow:** `20% – 40%` idle\n- **Red:** `< 20%` idle — Host/Docker VM is CPU-saturated across all running containers."
    },
