    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "epricing-service Memory",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#9FC119",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 500000000
              },
              {
                "color": "#E02F44",
                "value": 800000000
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(container_memory_working_set_bytes{name=~\".*epricing-service.*\"}) or sum(jvm_memory_used_bytes{job=\"epricing-service\", area=\"heap\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Working Set",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**ePricing Container Working Set Memory**\n\nActive RAM working set (heap + metaspace + native/direct buffers + OS page cache) via `max(container_memory_working_set_bytes)`, falling back to JVM heap if cAdvisor lacks cgroup metrics. Docker Compose memory limit is `2048 MiB` (`MaxRAMPercentage=60%` = ~`1.2 GiB` heap).\n\n- **Green:** `< 500 MB` | **Yellow:** `500 – 800 MB` | **Red:** `≥ 800 MB` (higher baseline ~1.1 GB is expected once warmed under `InitialRAMPercentage=50%`)."
    },
