      "description": "**Container CPU Utilization Comparison (Over Time)**\n\nMulti-series CPU percentage (`100% = 1 full core`) across core stack containers: `epricing-service`, `yugabytedb`, `prometheus`, `grafana`, and `loki`.\n\n- **Note:** Core stack also runs `kafka`, `temporal`, `otel-collector`, and `tempo` (not plotted separately here); check *Node CPU by Mode* if total host CPU spikes."
