      "description": "**Container Working-Set Memory Over Time (`bytes`)**\n\nAggregates `max(container_memory_working_set_bytes)` per service to avoid duplicate series after container restarts, comparing `epricing-service`, `yugabytedb`, `prometheus`, `grafana`, and `loki`.\n\n- **Healthy:** Flat or bounded plateau. A monotonic upward slope over hours without plateauing suggests a memory leak or unbounded TSDB/cache growth."
