      "description": "**Container & Host Network Inbound Throughput (`bytes/s`)**\n\n1-minute rate of received bytes per Docker virtual interface (`container_network_receive_bytes_total`, excluding `lo` and `br-*`) overlaid with total host `node_network_receive_bytes_total`.\n\n- **Use:** Verifies HTTP/SQL/OTLP/Kafka packet flow and detects sudden ingress blackouts (`0 B/s`)."
    },
